   "design": "Student organizations submit event and budget requests through a form in the university's workflow tool ({WORKFLOW}) that shows their remaining budget and attaches the event's risk checklist, so the adviser reviews one complete request instead of piecing it together from e-mails. A handbook page answers common rule questions. Advising the board and attending events stay with the lecturer.",
